				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T02:17:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>中は　危ないよ▼
ヤーコンさんの　許可が　ないと
