	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05_swleader5_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヤーコン「おう！　まだいたか▼
なかなかの　たたかい　だったからな
いいところへ　つれて　いってやるぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:23:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:23:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヤーコン「おう！　まだいたか▼
なかなかの　戦い　だったからな
いいところへ　連れて　いってやるぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:24:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:23:58" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けてswrival_06</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:27:50" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ヤーコン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:20:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:21:05" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05_swrival_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『あのさ　なんで
プラズマだんを　ゆるしてるんだ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:22:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:22:30" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『あのさ　なんで
プラズマ団を　赦してるんだ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:23:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:22:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けてswleader5_02
・1＝ライバル名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:27:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:22:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:27:32" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05_swleader5_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヤーコン『なんにだって
うけざらは　ひつようさ▼
それに　ただしさ　ばかりを　もとめると
じぶんたち　いがいの　すべての▽
いけん　かんがえを　ひていしかねない▽
それが　どんなに　あぶないことか▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:38:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:27:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヤーコン『なんにだって
受け皿は　必要さ▼
それに　正しさ　ばかりを　求めると
自分たち　以外の　すべての▽
意見　考えを　否定しかねない▽
それが　どんなに　危ないことか▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:37:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:35:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けてswrival_07</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:31:18" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ヤーコン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:25:35" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:27:32" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05_swrival_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『フウン
それが　おとなの　はんだん　てやつ？▼
まあ　いいさ！　オレは　オレで
プラズマだんと　むきあうからさ▼
で　オッサンが　いってた
いい　ところ　って　なんだよ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:33:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:32:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『フウン
それが　大人の　判断て　やつ？▼
まあ　いいさ！　オレは　オレで
プラズマ団と　向き合うからさ▼
で　オッサンが　いってた
いい　ところ　って　なんだよ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:37:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:35:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けてswleader5_03
・1＝ライバル名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:33:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:28:43" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:28:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05_swleader5_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヤーコン『きいたことが　ないか？
ワールドバトルトーナメント▼
かくちの　トレーナーを　あつめ
つよいのは　だれか　きめるのさ！▼
まちの　みなみに　あるからな
では　まってるぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:34:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:34:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヤーコン『きいたことが　ないか？
ワールドバトルトーナメント▼
各地の　トレーナーを　集め
強いのは　だれか　決めるのさ！▼
街の　南に　あるからな
では　待ってるぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:37:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:35:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・表示後、ＷＢＴのほうへ移動
・続けてswrival_08</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:35:39" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ヤーコン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:30:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:30:43" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05_swrival_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『つよい　ヤツを　きめる
トーナメントか！　おもしろそうだな！！▽
いっちょ　うでだめしに　いくか！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:35:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:34:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『強い　ヤツを　決める
トーナメントか！　おもしろそうだな！！▽
いっちょ　腕試しに　行くか！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:36:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:35:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・表示後、ＷＢＴのほうへ移動
　画面外に消えると主人公操作可能に
・c05r0701のストッパー解除
・1＝ライバル名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:36:06" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:30:56" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:31:02" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
